data: {"type":"response.reasoning_summary_text.done","item_id":"rs_0dcce7238498c4ca016aca05345bd887d2a5bcda96cd17f374","output_index":0,"sequence_number":82,"summary_index":0,"text":"**Considering test updates**\n\nI'm thinking about how to manage test updates effectively. It seems like adding tests can be seamless when I append unique identifiers during migration updates. I could also reuse helpers to make things simpler. Creating a separate test file for any duplicates might be a good idea to avoid undesirable edits, and I should make sure to insert new test headers before the migration. That way, everything stays organized and clear!"}

